Found a general store yet? Different Scrolls have different prices, and 
Identify Scrolls are the cheapest of the lot (I think). Find out the 
scroll that's so cheap it's unfunny, bless it, and you have a decent 
chance of getting /everything/ in your inventory IDed.

As for general methods, Gems can also be partially determined by 
engraving. Engraving will tell you whether it's soft or hard - a hard 
gen is always valuable. Soft ones can either be valuable or not, but at 
least it's a start. Also, If you're blessing stuff, find a touchstone 
and bless it, to be able to instantly identify any gem. Also, Throwing 
gems to Unicorns is also an easy way to identify gems (although, of 
course, you'll lose the gem if it's valuable.)

